contract_change:
  api: "pm history-repair --append-only, HistoryRepairCommandOptions.appendOnly, HistoryRepairResult.bridge, HistoryEntry.bridge, verifyHistoryChainWithVersion and HistoryMergeStrategy"
  before: "The only repair for a broken history chain re-anchored every recorded entry after the break, and HistoryMergeStrategy had four members"
  after: "--append-only (SDK and MCP appendOnly) appends one sealed history_repair record whose bridge names each break and leaves every earlier line byte-identical; verifyHistoryChainWithVersion accepts a break only when the next bridge names it and reports bridged_segments; the history merge driver adds the equivalent_bridges strategy; pm health names --append-only as the remedy for history_drift_chain_mismatch"
  migrate: Add a case for equivalent_bridges to exhaustive switches over HistoryMergeStrategy; raw history readers should ignore the optional bridge field or verify through verifyHistoryChainWithVersion
